WEBVTT

01:30.390 --> 01:34.990
[The Heir]

01:35.360 --> 01:37.940
[Episode 7]

01:40.229 --> 01:41.200
Eldest Young Master,

01:41.200 --> 01:42.039
let's go.

01:42.870 --> 01:44.070
It's almost done.

01:45.430 --> 01:48.090
We're running out of time,
Eldest Young Master!

01:48.430 --> 01:49.039
Right.

01:50.680 --> 01:52.789
Send all the servants in the house away

01:52.789 --> 01:54.390
so they won't be implicated.

01:54.410 --> 01:55.070
Go quickly.

01:56.560 --> 01:57.430
Okay.

02:03.790 --> 02:04.920
Where is your Eldest Young Master?

02:04.920 --> 02:06.040
In his study.

02:16.230 --> 02:17.150
Luo Wensong,

02:17.790 --> 02:19.120
I'm here for Ronghua.

02:19.630 --> 02:20.630
Since neither of you

02:20.630 --> 02:21.750
has any feelings for the other,

02:21.750 --> 02:22.910
why not let her off?

02:25.190 --> 02:27.150
Just write the betrothal annulment letter.

02:27.150 --> 02:28.000
Luo Wensong,

02:28.560 --> 02:30.030
did you hear me?

02:31.120 --> 02:32.150
Luo Wensong!

02:43.190 --> 02:43.960
Zhen,

02:44.710 --> 02:45.400
look.

02:46.750 --> 02:47.800
Did I make it?

02:48.800 --> 02:49.560
Look.

02:50.360 --> 02:51.240
They blended.

02:53.560 --> 02:54.190
Look.

02:59.079 --> 03:00.080
I did it.

03:00.470 --> 03:01.670
This new inkstick...

03:03.680 --> 03:04.880
I've finally made it.

03:05.310 --> 03:06.150
I made it!

03:06.150 --> 03:06.910
I finally made it!

03:06.910 --> 03:07.400
Eldest Young Master!

03:07.400 --> 03:07.930
Quick...

03:13.360 --> 03:14.220
Don't touch it!

03:27.750 --> 03:29.400
The day the inkstick is born

03:30.590 --> 03:32.320
is also the day it is destroyed.

03:32.800 --> 03:33.630
Eldest Young Master,

03:33.630 --> 03:34.590
let's go!

03:34.590 --> 03:36.470
If we don't leave now,
the officers will come!

03:36.470 --> 03:37.190
Officers?

03:37.400 --> 03:38.530
It's Heaven's will.

03:39.960 --> 03:40.840
Luo Wensong,

03:41.760 --> 03:43.420
what happened to your family?

03:44.310 --> 03:45.079
Zhen.

03:49.030 --> 03:50.079
Look.

03:51.190 --> 03:53.320
Does what has befallen my family today

03:54.630 --> 03:56.630
remind you of when the Li family lost

03:56.630 --> 03:58.910
the Tribute Ink commission
all those years ago?

03:58.910 --> 04:00.150
Why brought that up?

04:00.560 --> 04:01.590
I was still young then.

04:01.590 --> 04:02.850
I don't remember much.

04:03.590 --> 04:04.680
This inkstick

04:05.190 --> 04:07.240
surpasses all others in the world.

04:08.110 --> 04:08.910
But

04:10.590 --> 04:13.400
I refuse to hand it over to those vile,

04:13.400 --> 04:14.660
scheming scoundrels.

04:17.070 --> 04:18.120
What should I do?

04:21.510 --> 04:22.190
Ping'an.

04:22.800 --> 04:23.430
Burn them.

04:23.800 --> 04:24.560
Burn them?

04:25.040 --> 04:25.950
Eldest Young Master!

04:25.950 --> 04:26.920
You... You...

04:28.800 --> 04:31.060
What are you doing, Eldest Young Master?

04:31.360 --> 04:31.750
Well...

04:31.750 --> 04:32.950
What are you doing?

04:33.360 --> 04:33.870
You...

04:33.870 --> 04:34.310
Luo Wensong!

04:34.310 --> 04:35.040
You can't burn them!

04:35.040 --> 04:35.310
Luo Wensong!

04:35.310 --> 04:36.240
Don't burn them!

04:38.070 --> 04:38.750
Let go!

04:42.120 --> 04:43.360
Eldest Young Master!

04:45.390 --> 04:46.360
Luo Wensong,

04:47.070 --> 04:48.600
no matter what happened to your family,

04:48.600 --> 04:49.490
as long as you're alive

04:49.490 --> 04:50.510
and still have your craft,

04:50.510 --> 04:52.430
there is always a chance
to turn things around.

04:52.430 --> 04:53.960
But if you burn everything,

04:54.310 --> 04:55.360
there's no going back!

04:55.360 --> 04:56.630
Everything will be gone!

04:56.630 --> 04:58.310
If it's gone, then so be it.

04:59.190 --> 05:00.270
As the saying goes,

05:00.480 --> 05:02.480
"When the Way prevails, one serves;

05:03.070 --> 05:05.800
when it does not,
one withdraws into obscurity."

05:06.510 --> 05:07.310
Luo Wensong,

05:07.910 --> 05:10.030
you really disappoint me today!

05:10.240 --> 05:12.120
That doesn't sound like you at all!

05:12.120 --> 05:13.310
What should I say?

05:14.480 --> 05:15.810
Unmoved by worldly gain

05:16.680 --> 05:17.830
or personal loss.

05:23.000 --> 05:24.530
Unmoved by worldly gain...

05:27.630 --> 05:28.950
or personal loss.

05:37.310 --> 05:38.840
Unmoved by worldly gain...

05:44.070 --> 05:45.720
or personal loss.

05:46.920 --> 05:48.120
Well said.

06:03.190 --> 06:04.160
Do me a favor.

06:06.600 --> 06:08.130
Keep this "Ink Chronicles"

06:09.600 --> 06:10.630
safe for me.

06:23.270 --> 06:24.240
Eldest Young Master!

06:24.240 --> 06:25.040
Eldest Young Master,

06:25.040 --> 06:26.270
the officers are already at the gate!

06:26.270 --> 06:27.560
We have to leave now!

06:33.510 --> 06:34.570
Where are we going?

06:35.950 --> 06:36.950
Just come with me.

06:40.970 --> 06:41.840
Go in and search!

06:41.840 --> 06:43.070
Don't let anyone escape!

06:43.070 --> 06:44.240
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

06:44.240 --> 06:44.800
Yes, sir!

06:45.070 --> 06:46.040
This way, sir.

06:46.270 --> 06:47.240
Hurry up! Hurry!

07:05.560 --> 07:06.420
Luo Wensong...

07:07.830 --> 07:09.240
Where exactly are you taking me?

07:09.240 --> 07:11.210
I'm now a fugitive wanted by the court.

07:11.210 --> 07:12.230
If they find you with me,

07:12.230 --> 07:13.760
you'll be caught up in this.

07:14.120 --> 07:14.720
You...

07:15.270 --> 07:16.230
Hide here.

07:16.430 --> 07:19.030
You can only leave
after the officers are gone.

07:19.360 --> 07:20.160
Luo Wensong!

07:22.560 --> 07:23.360
Luo Wensong,

07:24.680 --> 07:26.610
you must go on living and live well.

07:36.390 --> 07:37.159
Anyone there?

07:37.159 --> 07:37.630
No!

07:37.659 --> 07:38.010
Let's go

07:38.010 --> 07:39.070
and search inside!

08:21.360 --> 08:22.190
Did you check over there?

08:22.190 --> 08:22.630
No.

08:22.830 --> 08:23.360
Go check over there!

08:23.360 --> 08:23.890
Yes, sir!

08:34.280 --> 08:35.070
Eldest Young Master Tian,

08:35.070 --> 08:36.200
did you find anyone?

08:36.240 --> 08:37.120
I've searched this area.

08:37.120 --> 08:37.850
No one found.

08:38.030 --> 08:38.510
Boss,

08:38.549 --> 08:39.360
I've searched outside,

08:39.360 --> 08:39.960
and no one has been found.

08:39.960 --> 08:42.080
We didn't find anyone
inside the house either.

08:42.080 --> 08:43.360
If we can't catch anyone,

08:43.360 --> 08:45.760
we won't be able to
answer to our superiors.

08:46.150 --> 08:46.870
Sir,

08:47.550 --> 08:48.790
I know another place.

08:49.150 --> 08:51.030
Luo Wensong will definitely go there.

08:51.030 --> 08:51.890
Sir, follow me.

09:27.480 --> 09:28.320
Everyone, hurry up the mountain!

09:28.320 --> 09:29.630
Don't let Luo Wensong escape!

09:29.630 --> 09:30.200
Yes, sir!

09:40.910 --> 09:41.480
Sir,

09:41.480 --> 09:42.480
this is the place.

09:45.030 --> 09:46.150
Surround Jingxin Hall!

09:46.150 --> 09:47.350
-Yes, sir!
-Yes, sir!

09:48.600 --> 09:49.480
Brother!

09:50.870 --> 09:51.600
Brother!

09:54.260 --> 09:55.050
Butler!

09:55.910 --> 09:56.960
Butler!

09:58.030 --> 09:59.080
Luo Wensong!

09:59.480 --> 10:00.510
Luo Wensong!

10:00.840 --> 10:01.510
Luo...

10:04.790 --> 10:05.590
Young Master!

10:06.000 --> 10:06.930
To Jingxin Hall!

10:14.840 --> 10:15.510
Young Master.

10:15.510 --> 10:16.310
Young Master.

10:16.670 --> 10:17.830
The officers have surrounded us
from all sides.

10:17.830 --> 10:18.760
We can't escape.

10:18.910 --> 10:20.170
Fugitive Luo Wensong,

10:21.000 --> 10:22.600
you have nowhere left to run!

10:22.910 --> 10:24.550
Come out and surrender now!

10:29.200 --> 10:29.960
Sir,

10:30.630 --> 10:31.670
I have an idea.

10:32.240 --> 10:33.080
What idea?

10:36.200 --> 10:37.330
Set the place on fire

10:37.600 --> 10:38.930
and see if they come out.

10:39.440 --> 10:40.300
Break the door!

10:40.480 --> 10:41.480
Luo Wensong!

10:41.720 --> 10:42.920
If you don't come out,

10:43.030 --> 10:45.090
I'll burn Jingxin Hall to the ground!

10:45.480 --> 10:46.540
Wait for me inside.

10:46.960 --> 10:48.120
I'll go talk to them.

10:49.080 --> 10:49.870
Wensong!

10:51.120 --> 10:52.360
Even if the sky falls,

10:52.750 --> 10:54.750
we will face it together as a family!

11:04.630 --> 11:05.690
Grab your weapons!

11:41.240 --> 11:42.440
You are Luo Wensong?

11:43.120 --> 11:43.960
I am.

11:46.030 --> 11:48.230
County Magistrate Zhao Shen
has orders

11:48.750 --> 11:51.790
that all members of your family
must be taken back for investigation.

11:51.790 --> 11:53.960
May I see the arrest warrant?

11:54.360 --> 11:55.760
The warrant is on its way.

11:56.200 --> 11:57.360
Why do you have so many questions?

11:57.360 --> 11:58.270
Young Master,

11:58.480 --> 11:59.750
we were still too late.

11:59.840 --> 12:01.440
Why are there so many constables?

12:01.440 --> 12:02.200
Luo Wensong!

12:02.840 --> 12:04.150
Surrender at once.

12:05.440 --> 12:06.440
Tian Benchang.

12:07.630 --> 12:09.200
My father was right.

12:09.480 --> 12:12.000
We really raised a fine, loyal dog.

12:12.870 --> 12:13.480
Luo Wensong, you...

12:13.480 --> 12:14.340
Tian Benchang?

12:14.790 --> 12:16.200
Does he work for us?

12:16.340 --> 12:18.000
Why is he with those officers?

12:20.510 --> 12:21.510
Chief Constable,

12:22.030 --> 12:24.030
may I negotiate something with you?

12:24.960 --> 12:27.000
My aunt married out years ago

12:27.320 --> 12:29.390
and is no longer part of the Luo family.

12:29.390 --> 12:31.200
Can you let her go?

12:31.320 --> 12:32.360
I will go with you.

12:32.630 --> 12:33.750
And if he refuses,

12:34.120 --> 12:35.080
what will you do?

12:36.200 --> 12:37.750
If you don't let my aunt go,

12:38.200 --> 12:40.720
I'm afraid I cannot surrender willingly.

12:41.200 --> 12:42.960
Luo Wensong, you're resisting arrest!

12:42.960 --> 12:44.620
If you don't surrender today,

12:44.750 --> 12:46.390
the officers will raze this place
to the ground

12:46.390 --> 12:47.360
and wipe out your entire family!

12:47.360 --> 12:48.240
I dare you!

12:49.720 --> 12:50.440
Tian Benchang,

12:50.440 --> 12:51.750
you treacherous dog!

12:54.080 --> 12:54.870
Ping'an!

12:56.510 --> 12:57.600
Take them down!

12:58.000 --> 12:58.790
Ping'an!

12:59.150 --> 13:00.120
Ping'an!

13:01.200 --> 13:01.840
Brother!

13:02.840 --> 13:03.640
Young Master!

13:06.840 --> 13:08.080
Don't let him escape!

13:08.150 --> 13:08.750
Sir!

13:09.080 --> 13:10.080
He's running away!

13:10.080 --> 13:10.750
Get him!

13:11.030 --> 13:11.480
Sir!

13:11.480 --> 13:12.200
Catch him!

13:12.510 --> 13:13.770
Don't let him get away!

13:20.600 --> 13:21.600
Luo Wensong!

13:21.630 --> 13:22.670
Come out!

13:23.030 --> 13:24.080
Luo Wensong!

13:25.870 --> 13:26.870
Luo Wensong!

13:33.550 --> 13:34.960
Torch it!

13:35.910 --> 13:36.790
Burn it down!

13:59.720 --> 14:00.520
My brother...

14:00.720 --> 14:03.000
My brother and my aunt are still inside...

14:03.000 --> 14:04.710
Young Master, you can't go.

14:04.870 --> 14:05.790
Otherwise, the Old Master
would've died in vain.

14:05.790 --> 14:07.120
You must live!

14:11.750 --> 14:12.480
Young Master,

14:12.480 --> 14:13.080
let's go.

14:13.480 --> 14:14.120
Young Master.

14:14.120 --> 14:15.030
Young Master.

14:15.510 --> 14:16.150
Let's go.

14:16.600 --> 14:17.150
Yes.

14:30.980 --> 14:35.220
[Jingxin Hall]

14:46.150 --> 14:47.150
Torch it!

14:47.320 --> 14:48.720
Burn it down!

14:50.440 --> 14:51.510
Burn it!

15:35.550 --> 15:36.350
Young Master.

15:38.080 --> 15:39.030
Are you alright?

15:43.600 --> 15:45.200
Let's rest here for a while.

15:54.000 --> 15:54.870
Young Master,

15:55.150 --> 15:56.270
have a bite first.

16:05.480 --> 16:05.940
What...

16:05.960 --> 16:06.890
What do you want?

16:07.910 --> 16:09.720
Hand over all your valuables.

16:11.600 --> 16:12.240
Get up.

16:12.510 --> 16:13.480
Get up!

16:18.600 --> 16:19.120
Boss!

16:20.600 --> 16:21.200
Boss!

16:21.790 --> 16:22.850
Search carefully.

16:28.320 --> 16:28.790
This looks good.

16:28.790 --> 16:29.510
Let me see.

16:31.840 --> 16:32.570
Give it to me.

16:33.030 --> 16:33.600
This...

16:33.600 --> 16:34.600
This is worthless.

16:34.600 --> 16:35.860
It's just an inkstick.

16:35.870 --> 16:37.000
Give it to me!

16:37.000 --> 16:37.780
It's really worth nothing.

16:37.780 --> 16:39.040
It's just an inkstick!

16:39.080 --> 16:39.910
Young Master!

16:46.240 --> 16:47.080
Jixiang!

16:48.000 --> 16:49.480
I'll kill you!

16:50.510 --> 16:52.320
I'll strangle you!

17:15.829 --> 17:16.790
Let's go. Let's go!

17:16.790 --> 17:17.510
Hurry, hurry!

17:17.510 --> 17:18.000
Hurry!

17:27.160 --> 17:30.110
[Wang Cuiqiao]

17:40.400 --> 17:41.400
You're awake.

17:45.350 --> 17:46.440
Thank you, Madam,

17:47.030 --> 17:48.350
for saving my buddy and me.

17:48.350 --> 17:50.110
This place is desolate and dangerous.

17:50.110 --> 17:51.240
Once you've rested,

17:51.240 --> 17:52.770
go home as soon as possible.

17:53.310 --> 17:54.000
Okay.

17:54.590 --> 17:55.720
Understood, Madam.

17:56.880 --> 17:58.270
I'm not some madam.

17:58.400 --> 17:59.680
I'm just a merchant.

17:59.910 --> 18:02.060
Our family was also in trade once.

18:02.310 --> 18:03.070
Is that so?

18:03.730 --> 18:04.590
What about now?

18:07.000 --> 18:07.920
Now...

18:10.750 --> 18:12.810
we were brought down by scheming men.

18:14.030 --> 18:15.070
Our home is gone.

18:16.510 --> 18:18.270
It's just the two of us left.

18:22.070 --> 18:23.070
Then...

18:23.590 --> 18:25.000
where are you going now?

18:25.480 --> 18:27.110
We're heading southeast

18:27.110 --> 18:29.030
to seek refuge with General Yu Dayong.

18:29.030 --> 18:30.270
General Yu Dayong?

18:31.240 --> 18:33.880
He's already redeployed
from the southeast to the north.

18:33.880 --> 18:34.960
Since we've crossed paths here,

18:34.960 --> 18:36.480
it must be fate.

18:37.350 --> 18:38.270
Well, then,

18:38.710 --> 18:40.030
travel with me.

18:40.350 --> 18:41.110
I'm also

18:41.350 --> 18:42.750
going to find General Yu.

18:47.110 --> 18:47.720
Let's go.

18:54.880 --> 18:55.720
Young Master,

18:56.510 --> 18:58.240
should we go with her?

19:02.400 --> 19:03.880
At least it'll be safer

19:03.880 --> 19:05.070
if we follow her.

19:06.110 --> 19:08.770
But we still need to
stay alert and play it by ear.

19:10.160 --> 19:11.110
Heroine,

19:11.200 --> 19:12.160
wait for us!

19:12.680 --> 19:13.440
Let's go.

19:13.750 --> 19:15.010
Let's go. Our luggage.

19:15.480 --> 19:16.160
I'll carry it.

19:16.160 --> 19:16.750
Let's go.

19:21.550 --> 19:22.810
[Yaji Hall]

19:36.530 --> 19:37.280
Wonderful!

19:37.310 --> 19:38.640
Wonderful, wonderful!

19:38.680 --> 19:39.480
Sir!

19:39.790 --> 19:41.110
Welcome, welcome.

19:41.310 --> 19:42.000
Okay, okay.

19:42.110 --> 19:43.750
Likewise, likewise!

19:43.880 --> 19:44.940
Congratulations!

19:45.240 --> 19:46.790
Thank you, thank you!

19:46.880 --> 19:47.680
Thank you.

19:48.030 --> 19:49.030
Likewise, likewise.

19:49.030 --> 19:50.480
Please come in, please!

19:56.110 --> 19:56.790
Zhen.

19:58.390 --> 19:58.980
Zhen,

19:59.000 --> 19:59.730
listen to me.

19:59.830 --> 20:01.110
I have something to tell you.

20:01.110 --> 20:01.860
Tian Benchang,

20:01.860 --> 20:03.390
I have nothing to say to you.

20:04.030 --> 20:05.160
Can you just let me go?

20:05.160 --> 20:06.220
Listen to me, Zhen.

20:07.030 --> 20:08.200
Now, there is

20:08.350 --> 20:10.480
nothing standing between us anymore.

20:10.720 --> 20:11.350
I know

20:11.350 --> 20:12.110
you resent me

20:12.200 --> 20:12.960
and hate me.

20:13.590 --> 20:14.550
Back then, I was weak.

20:14.550 --> 20:15.480
I was wrong.

20:16.030 --> 20:17.510
But things are different now.

20:17.510 --> 20:18.270
My family,

20:18.350 --> 20:18.920
I—

20:18.920 --> 20:20.200
everything has changed.

20:20.200 --> 20:21.480
I have everything now.

20:22.880 --> 20:23.790
So what?

20:24.830 --> 20:27.000
We'll never have to
worry about orders again,

20:27.000 --> 20:28.860
and we'll never have to scrape by.

20:29.680 --> 20:30.640
From now on,

20:30.680 --> 20:31.880
I'll make it up to you.

20:31.960 --> 20:34.110
I'll treat you as well as I possibly can.

20:34.110 --> 20:35.180
I'll come with a grand wedding procession

20:35.180 --> 20:37.350
-and marry you properly.
-Tian Benchang!

20:37.350 --> 20:39.440
You clearly saw me there that night.

20:40.070 --> 20:41.200
Yes, I saw you.

20:42.400 --> 20:43.400
If you had been caught,

20:43.400 --> 20:44.830
you would've been an accomplice.

20:44.830 --> 20:46.440
I was protecting you, Zhen.

20:46.750 --> 20:48.080
What about Luo Wensong?

20:48.790 --> 20:50.200
Did he have to die?

20:51.920 --> 20:53.720
Luo Wensong was a fugitive
wanted by the court.

20:53.720 --> 20:56.110
That was what he paid
for resisting arrest.

20:56.110 --> 20:57.110
Besides, Zhen,

20:57.680 --> 20:59.680
it was Luo Wensong who tore us apart.

21:00.070 --> 21:02.200
He made my family
suffer the deepest humiliation.

21:02.200 --> 21:04.460
Why are you speaking up for such a person?

21:05.070 --> 21:07.400
But what about the others in Jingxin Hall?

21:07.590 --> 21:09.200
They were all
cut from the same rotten cloth.

21:09.200 --> 21:10.680
That was entirely within the law!

21:10.680 --> 21:11.480
Besides,

21:11.750 --> 21:13.270
that was all done by the officials.

21:13.270 --> 21:13.960
What has any of that to do with me?

21:13.960 --> 21:15.200
I saw it all!

21:17.000 --> 21:18.640
You set that fire.

21:19.770 --> 21:21.400
I was in Jingxin Hall that day.

21:21.400 --> 21:22.550
I saw everything.

21:22.550 --> 21:24.810
You could've chosen not to set that fire!

21:26.310 --> 21:27.920
Before, in my eyes,

21:28.960 --> 21:31.240
my Benchang was a little timid

21:31.920 --> 21:33.400
but kind

21:33.750 --> 21:34.750
and gentle.

21:35.550 --> 21:37.080
But the person you are today

21:37.480 --> 21:39.240
terrifies me.

21:39.790 --> 21:42.000
How could you have become like this?

21:42.680 --> 21:43.750
Or

21:44.920 --> 21:46.790
is this who you really are?

21:47.830 --> 21:50.360
No matter what serious crime
they committed,

21:50.640 --> 21:52.040
they should've been
handed over to the authorities—

21:52.040 --> 21:53.890
not judged by you.

21:54.350 --> 21:56.240
Yet, for your own selfish gain,

21:56.270 --> 21:57.640
you killed them all!

21:58.400 --> 22:00.160
How are you any different

22:00.160 --> 22:01.820
from a bloodthirsty monster?

22:02.550 --> 22:03.480
Tian Benchang,

22:04.030 --> 22:06.090
we should never see each other again.

22:06.590 --> 22:08.320
I don't want to see you anymore.

22:09.510 --> 22:10.640
I did nothing wrong!

22:11.800 --> 22:13.440
Was I supposed to spend my whole life
carrying the status of a servant,

22:13.440 --> 22:14.160
letting others trample all over me?

22:14.160 --> 22:14.880
Let go of me!

22:14.880 --> 22:16.350
What's wrong with climbing my way up?

22:16.350 --> 22:17.000
Let go of me!

22:17.000 --> 22:18.400
We grew up together—

22:18.480 --> 22:21.010
you should understand me
better than anyone!

22:21.070 --> 22:21.680
Zhen,

22:21.790 --> 22:22.790
give me another chance.

22:22.790 --> 22:23.640
Let's go back to how things were.

22:23.640 --> 22:25.300
Let's start over, okay, Zhen?

22:27.510 --> 22:29.110
You've truly lost your mind!

22:58.270 --> 22:59.590
The Li and Luo families

23:00.200 --> 23:02.240
stood side by side in the ink industry

23:02.240 --> 23:04.160
for decades.

23:05.830 --> 23:08.270
I, too, competed in ink-making
against Luo Hanzhang

23:08.270 --> 23:09.720
several times.

23:10.720 --> 23:12.510
His talent for ink-making

23:14.200 --> 23:15.510
was no less than mine.

23:18.510 --> 23:19.590
What a pity.

23:21.310 --> 23:23.200
Today, the Luo family has fallen,

23:25.160 --> 23:27.420
and he died in the Capital, far from home.

23:31.200 --> 23:32.130
Grandfather...

23:34.480 --> 23:35.550
Actually...

23:36.480 --> 23:39.340
Actually, the day
the Luo family met with disaster,

23:40.200 --> 23:41.660
I was at the Luo residence.

23:44.550 --> 23:46.000
Did anyone see you?

23:46.750 --> 23:47.920
N-No.

23:47.920 --> 23:49.240
I went very discreetly,

23:49.240 --> 23:50.440
and no one noticed me.

23:52.840 --> 23:53.970
I went there that day

23:54.000 --> 23:56.590
to ask for a betrothal annulment letter
for Ronghua.

23:56.590 --> 23:58.160
But I never expected

23:59.270 --> 24:00.930
that I would happen to witness

24:01.030 --> 24:03.480
Eldest Young Master Luo dying in the fire.

24:05.240 --> 24:07.000
Zhen, oh, Zhen.

24:10.590 --> 24:11.680
You must never

24:11.790 --> 24:13.720
mention this to anyone else again.

24:19.400 --> 24:20.200
Grandfather,

24:20.750 --> 24:22.160
I just never expected

24:23.740 --> 24:25.340
that Eldest Young Master Luo

24:25.790 --> 24:27.250
would truly die like that.

24:29.160 --> 24:30.560
When all is said and done,

24:31.590 --> 24:33.110
he helped me once.

24:34.000 --> 24:35.590
I even have him to thank

24:36.070 --> 24:37.960
for my decision to pursue ink-making.

24:37.960 --> 24:39.110
What do you mean?

24:40.720 --> 24:41.880
Some time ago,

24:42.000 --> 24:45.000
when I went to the Luo household
to appraise pine soot,

24:45.270 --> 24:47.270
he said a few words

24:47.830 --> 24:49.000
that awakened me.

24:50.590 --> 24:52.110
It made me realize that...

24:53.750 --> 24:55.920
deep down, I truly love making ink,

24:56.640 --> 24:58.350
and I want to pursue it.

24:59.440 --> 25:00.880
But that night,

25:02.480 --> 25:04.640
when I watched him die in the flames,

25:06.030 --> 25:07.230
I finally understood

25:08.750 --> 25:11.010
that there are truly people in this world

25:11.920 --> 25:13.120
who treat ink-making

25:13.270 --> 25:15.270
as the calling of their entire life—

25:15.790 --> 25:17.320
rising and falling with it,

25:17.680 --> 25:19.080
living and dying with it.

25:20.590 --> 25:22.460
While I admired him deeply,

25:23.830 --> 25:25.090
I was also frightened.

25:27.070 --> 25:29.790
Suddenly, I no longer understood
why I made ink.

25:31.510 --> 25:33.200
Was it out of momentary pride?

25:34.160 --> 25:35.240
For money?

25:36.070 --> 25:37.200
For love of it?

25:38.350 --> 25:40.150
Or for something else entirely?

25:41.430 --> 25:42.950
I suddenly no longer knew.

25:46.880 --> 25:48.880
It must have weighed heavily on you,

25:49.500 --> 25:51.460
carrying such thoughts alone.

25:52.400 --> 25:53.240
Grandfather,

25:54.590 --> 25:56.440
I used to think

25:57.270 --> 25:59.600
Eldest Young Master Luo was just a madman,

26:00.310 --> 26:02.370
caring about nothing but making ink,

26:03.510 --> 26:05.510
and that we weren't on the same path.

26:06.900 --> 26:08.450
But what he said

26:09.110 --> 26:10.790
made a lot of sense to me.

26:12.030 --> 26:13.200
An ink maker

26:13.310 --> 26:15.710
should be wholly focused and undisturbed.

26:22.550 --> 26:24.030
Focused and undisturbed.

26:50.070 --> 26:51.640
The path of ink-making

26:52.680 --> 26:54.680
is full of hardships and obstacles.

26:55.350 --> 26:57.240
We grind the ink, and the ink

26:57.750 --> 26:58.960
shapes us in return.

27:00.960 --> 27:02.690
I've taught you how to make ink,

27:03.720 --> 27:06.380
not so you could become
some ordinary ink-maker

27:07.640 --> 27:09.790
scrambling to earn a living.

27:12.350 --> 27:14.030
What I want to pass on to you...

27:17.310 --> 27:18.510
is the Way of Ink.

27:19.400 --> 27:20.270
The Way of Ink?

27:26.920 --> 27:28.400
To remain upright and pure

27:29.310 --> 27:30.880
is the Li family's Way.

27:32.070 --> 27:33.870
To live and die alongside the ink

27:34.200 --> 27:36.000
was Luo Wensong's Way.

27:37.790 --> 27:40.050
Forging ties with the powerful and noble

27:40.510 --> 27:42.350
was Luo Hanzhang's Way.

27:47.030 --> 27:48.920
I truly hope

27:49.830 --> 27:50.830
that one day

27:52.510 --> 27:54.440
you can find your own Way.

27:56.160 --> 27:57.400
My own Way...

28:00.200 --> 28:01.400
I hope

28:01.920 --> 28:03.590
you can press forward

28:04.110 --> 28:05.790
carrying those questions.

28:06.590 --> 28:08.240
Keep questioning yourself,

28:09.070 --> 28:10.550
then shatter

28:11.030 --> 28:12.030
those doubts,

28:12.640 --> 28:14.100
and temper yourself anew.

28:15.240 --> 28:17.590
By repeating this process again and again,

28:17.590 --> 28:19.400
something indestructible

28:20.550 --> 28:22.550
will surely take root in your heart.

28:23.550 --> 28:24.350
Grandfather,

28:25.590 --> 28:27.350
although I still don't know

28:27.920 --> 28:29.510
what my own Way is right now,

28:30.640 --> 28:31.640
from now on,

28:32.030 --> 28:34.640
I'll do my best to trim
every lamp wick carefully,

28:34.640 --> 28:36.570
burn every bowl of lampblack well,

28:36.750 --> 28:39.280
and make every block of ink
as good as it can be.

28:44.520 --> 28:47.180
[Three Years Later]

28:55.400 --> 28:55.920
Father.

28:59.400 --> 29:00.260
How is it going?

29:01.160 --> 29:03.020
She's at the most critical stage?

29:08.960 --> 29:10.400
This is good stuff.

29:11.590 --> 29:13.000
When I was out grocery shopping today,

29:13.000 --> 29:14.400
I met a traveling merchant.

29:14.400 --> 29:16.510
He said this is top-quality
donkey-hide gelatin.

29:16.510 --> 29:17.160
I thought

29:17.160 --> 29:17.920
I'd make Zhen

29:18.240 --> 29:19.240
some chicken broth with it

29:19.240 --> 29:20.770
to replenish her strength.

29:21.830 --> 29:22.440
Grandfather!

29:22.440 --> 29:23.110
Zhen.

29:23.200 --> 29:24.030
Grandfather!

29:24.750 --> 29:26.030
Look at your face—

29:26.030 --> 29:27.110
you look like a dirty little monkey.

29:27.110 --> 29:27.480
Grandfather.

29:27.480 --> 29:28.400
Come on, Grandfather.

29:28.400 --> 29:29.960
Come see! I've made it!

29:30.030 --> 29:30.680
Let's go.

29:32.030 --> 29:32.640
Mother.

29:37.550 --> 29:38.400
Come and see.

29:48.960 --> 29:51.090
This one has large particles mixed in.

29:56.270 --> 29:57.800
This one is a bit underdone.

30:49.920 --> 30:50.590
Father,

30:51.110 --> 30:52.070
how is it?

30:55.750 --> 30:56.590
Zhen,

30:58.160 --> 30:59.240
tell me,

31:00.270 --> 31:01.440
what is the key here?

31:02.930 --> 31:04.240
Lampblack with uneven color,

31:04.240 --> 31:05.240
a coarse texture,

31:05.790 --> 31:07.250
and a dull, dry appearance

31:07.550 --> 31:08.960
is considered mid- to low-grade.

31:08.960 --> 31:10.620
But if the color is pure black,

31:10.720 --> 31:11.720
the texture fine,

31:11.830 --> 31:13.310
and it carries a subtle sheen,

31:13.310 --> 31:14.640
then it is of fine grade.

31:14.790 --> 31:17.270
However, if the tung oil used
is of exceptional quality,

31:17.270 --> 31:18.880
the burning method is proper,

31:18.880 --> 31:20.640
and the heat is precisely controlled,

31:20.640 --> 31:23.070
the lampblack produced will carry
a subtle grey undertone within the black—

31:23.070 --> 31:24.200
delicate and light.

31:25.030 --> 31:26.880
Then that's the rarest kind of all—

31:26.880 --> 31:27.750
supreme-grade lampblack.

31:27.750 --> 31:28.510
Good!

31:32.150 --> 31:33.030
To know

31:33.440 --> 31:34.840
what it is and why it is so—

31:36.310 --> 31:37.480
that's what makes

31:37.960 --> 31:39.290
a qualified ink-maker.

31:39.640 --> 31:40.270
Father,

31:40.640 --> 31:41.750
you mean...

31:42.720 --> 31:45.050
Zhen produced supreme-grade lampblack?

31:47.960 --> 31:49.110
That's great, Zhen.

31:52.070 --> 31:52.870
Grandfather.

31:54.640 --> 31:55.550
Does that mean

31:56.750 --> 31:58.750
I've graduated from your tutelage?

32:11.720 --> 32:12.780
It's getting late.

32:13.270 --> 32:14.310
Add a meat dish

32:15.110 --> 32:16.310
to tonight's dinner.

32:17.680 --> 32:18.590
Alright, Father!

32:18.590 --> 32:20.250
I'll go prepare it right away!

32:20.590 --> 32:21.440
That's great!

32:22.480 --> 32:23.740
You're amazing, Zhen.

32:46.550 --> 32:47.830
Honored ancestors,

32:49.200 --> 32:50.110
Zhen

32:50.550 --> 32:53.030
has studied the art of ink-making
for three years.

32:53.030 --> 32:55.560
To keep her from
growing proud and impatient,

32:55.640 --> 32:57.830
I would scold and criticize her

32:58.750 --> 33:00.350
whenever she made progress,

33:01.270 --> 33:03.130
which caused her much suffering.

33:04.440 --> 33:05.550
Yet this child

33:06.270 --> 33:07.400
proved resilient,

33:07.790 --> 33:09.120
unafraid of obstacles,

33:09.480 --> 33:10.880
and progressed rapidly—

33:11.200 --> 33:12.930
often putting even me to shame.

33:13.200 --> 33:14.550
To me,

33:15.200 --> 33:17.000
ink has always been life itself.

33:17.310 --> 33:18.200
And yet

33:18.920 --> 33:20.650
I was forced to give up halfway.

33:21.960 --> 33:23.830
My heart had long since withered.

33:25.640 --> 33:27.100
Thanks to heaven's grace,

33:27.790 --> 33:28.720
Zhen

33:29.270 --> 33:31.590
has attained proficiency in ink-making.

33:31.590 --> 33:32.790
In just three years,

33:33.270 --> 33:36.130
she's already produced
supreme-grade lampblack.

33:37.000 --> 33:38.640
Ancestors above,

33:40.440 --> 33:41.350
Li Ink's legacy

33:42.790 --> 33:44.200
has a worthy successor.

33:47.270 --> 33:48.800
We have a worthy successor.

33:51.000 --> 33:52.530
We have a worthy successor.

33:56.720 --> 33:57.920
I heard there was another dispute

33:57.920 --> 33:59.920
at the ink workshop.

34:00.480 --> 34:01.400
It's all because

34:01.400 --> 34:04.270
the master craftsmen
are all talk and no skill.

34:04.750 --> 34:06.110
They can't produce good ink,

34:06.110 --> 34:07.440
yet all day long they keep demanding

34:07.440 --> 34:08.550
higher wages.

34:09.000 --> 34:09.710
Aunt Rujun,

34:10.449 --> 34:12.150
you've seen the ledgers yourself.

34:12.150 --> 34:15.290
Although our family's 10 years
of heavy taxation have ended,

34:15.290 --> 34:17.510
business at the workshop is now bleak.

34:17.920 --> 34:20.320
Where would we
get the spare money for them?

34:23.190 --> 34:24.150
We

34:24.440 --> 34:25.630
also want to

34:25.670 --> 34:27.480
pay them more.

34:29.060 --> 34:30.060
It's just

34:30.400 --> 34:31.630
that times have changed.

34:31.630 --> 34:33.590
We truly can't afford it.

34:34.639 --> 34:36.300
Let alone the workers' wages,

34:36.580 --> 34:39.550
even the monthly allowances for
our own family members are still overdue.

34:39.550 --> 34:43.280
[Li Zhengyou, Legitimate Grandson
of the Seventh Branch—Son of Sun Wanyi]

34:40.440 --> 34:43.190
I can only patch one hole
by tearing open another.

34:43.670 --> 34:44.480
Jiangyue,

34:44.880 --> 34:47.070
the ink workshop has its difficulties.

34:47.070 --> 34:48.070
I understand.

34:48.400 --> 34:51.030
I vaguely heard a few days ago

34:51.360 --> 34:53.510
that those big clients who have patronized

34:53.510 --> 34:54.840
our business for years

34:55.110 --> 34:56.920
have now switched to the Tian family.

34:56.920 --> 34:57.850
The Tian family?

34:57.920 --> 34:59.480
They only got where they are

34:59.550 --> 35:02.150
by seizing the Luo family's
estate and workshops.

35:02.150 --> 35:02.950
Without that,

35:03.110 --> 35:04.230
would their own abilities

35:04.230 --> 35:05.230
have been enough?

35:05.360 --> 35:06.280
Jingdong,

35:07.230 --> 35:08.320
watch your words.

35:08.440 --> 35:09.230
Aunt Rujun,

35:09.630 --> 35:10.890
we're all family here.

35:10.960 --> 35:12.820
What's there that cannot be said?

35:12.880 --> 35:15.510
The Tian family's rise was paved

35:15.510 --> 35:16.760
with the Luo family's blood!

35:16.760 --> 35:18.880
Every coin they've earned is ill-gotten.

35:18.880 --> 35:19.670
And now,

35:20.150 --> 35:21.150
they've even colluded

35:21.150 --> 35:21.960
with the County Magistrate

35:21.960 --> 35:23.220
and powerful figures.

35:23.920 --> 35:27.250
They don't even respect
the Literary Association anymore.

35:28.280 --> 35:29.800
In today's Huizhou,

35:30.630 --> 35:32.030
I'm afraid no one

35:32.110 --> 35:34.550
dares to s-stand against them.

35:39.920 --> 35:40.840
Zhengshen?

35:54.280 --> 35:55.540
Seventh Grandmother.

35:55.880 --> 35:56.680
Grandfather.

35:56.880 --> 35:57.510
Father.

35:57.670 --> 35:58.480
Mother.

36:00.320 --> 36:01.070
Eldest Aunt.

36:01.360 --> 36:02.190
Fourth Aunt.

36:02.710 --> 36:04.150
Don't you know

36:04.760 --> 36:06.030
there's a family banquet

36:06.030 --> 36:08.110
on the first and fifteenth of every month?

36:08.110 --> 36:10.710
Why did you only show up
after the meal was over?

36:10.760 --> 36:12.090
Don't just stand there!

36:12.510 --> 36:14.670
Apologize to your seventh grandmother now.

36:14.670 --> 36:15.960
Please forgive me, Seventh Grandmother.

36:15.200 --> 36:17.800
[Li Zhengshen, Eldest Grandson
of the Li Family’s Sixth Branch]

36:16.070 --> 36:17.470
Although I arrived late,

36:17.630 --> 36:19.110
I've brought back

36:19.320 --> 36:20.030
this divine elixir

36:20.030 --> 36:20.960
for you,

36:21.710 --> 36:24.150
Grandfather, and Father.

36:26.320 --> 36:27.710
They say it's very effective.

36:27.710 --> 36:29.110
Prolonging life

36:29.190 --> 36:31.520
and curing illnesses are just the basics.

36:32.110 --> 36:33.440
Even my father's leg—

36:33.440 --> 36:34.770
if he takes this elixir,

36:34.800 --> 36:35.920
given time,

36:36.110 --> 36:37.840
he'll be able to walk
as swiftly as the wind.

36:37.840 --> 36:38.440
You...

36:38.440 --> 36:40.230
Walk as swiftly as the wind, huh?

36:40.230 --> 36:41.070
Father!

36:42.030 --> 36:42.840
Seventh Grandmother,

36:42.840 --> 36:44.030
I'm not fooling you.

36:44.070 --> 36:45.530
This elixir is truly rare.

36:45.760 --> 36:48.030
I heard that whenever Master Tian
goes to the capital

36:48.030 --> 36:49.920
to curry favor with officials and nobles,

36:49.920 --> 36:51.360
this elixir is included
among the gifts he presents!

36:51.360 --> 36:52.320
Unfilial son!

36:52.400 --> 36:54.070
I'll beat you to death today!

36:54.070 --> 36:54.920
Jingdong!

36:56.800 --> 36:58.710
Let's talk about it when we get back.

36:58.710 --> 36:59.670
Zhengshen,

37:00.630 --> 37:02.840
do you still remember
our family's rules?

37:02.840 --> 37:04.960
On every festive reunion day,

37:05.670 --> 37:08.400
it is time to test the art of ink.

37:11.150 --> 37:12.550
Bring the inksticks up.

37:21.440 --> 37:22.800
This is...

37:32.710 --> 37:33.710
This inkstick

37:33.760 --> 37:35.840
smells wonderfully fragrant.

37:36.760 --> 37:38.150
And the pattern is

37:38.800 --> 37:40.200
quite flashy and ornate.

37:40.230 --> 37:41.890
It must be Tian Ink's product.

37:49.510 --> 37:51.240
This one smells quite nice too.

37:51.670 --> 37:52.920
Maybe it's

37:53.550 --> 37:54.680
Chen Ink's product.

38:00.590 --> 38:02.320
This piece looks

38:02.320 --> 38:03.510
very ordinary,

38:03.630 --> 38:05.490
with nothing ingenious about it.

38:07.550 --> 38:09.590
Even the scent is quite common.

38:14.440 --> 38:16.700
I'm afraid this one was made by my father.

38:18.880 --> 38:20.440
Then let's see

38:21.000 --> 38:22.600
if Zhengshen got them right.

38:24.060 --> 38:27.200
[Zhao Ink]

38:27.550 --> 38:29.910
[Cao Ink]

38:31.530 --> 38:32.720
[Li Ink]

38:34.190 --> 38:35.760
Look, Seventh Grandmother.

38:35.760 --> 38:37.360
Ordinary, huh?

38:37.360 --> 38:39.400
I'll beat you to death,
you rebellious son!

38:39.400 --> 38:40.150
Calm down! Calm down.

38:40.150 --> 38:40.670
Father,

38:40.670 --> 38:42.510
at least I recognized
the inkstick you made!

38:42.510 --> 38:43.360
I think you're

38:43.360 --> 38:44.630
far too consumed by your obsession!

38:44.630 --> 38:46.000
That's why you can't produce
truly good ink.

38:46.000 --> 38:47.190
As the saying goes,

38:47.320 --> 38:48.320
"Desire nothing,

38:48.320 --> 38:49.760
and all things follow."

38:49.800 --> 38:52.460
You've completely
disgraced the Sixth Branch!

38:53.190 --> 38:54.070
Enough!

38:55.920 --> 38:56.800
What kind of behavior is this

38:56.800 --> 38:58.130
in front of your elders?

38:58.710 --> 39:00.240
Sorry, I lost my composure.

39:01.480 --> 39:04.010
I am indeed disappointed
by my son's failure.

39:04.320 --> 39:05.070
But I...

39:08.070 --> 39:09.710
But I hate myself even more.

39:11.590 --> 39:13.920
Ever since our family fell into hardship,

39:15.400 --> 39:18.000
our branch
has shouldered the entire burden.

39:18.510 --> 39:20.400
Day after day, I exhaust every thought,

39:20.400 --> 39:22.400
not daring to slacken for even a moment.

39:22.400 --> 39:25.130
I've spent my days and nights
in the ink workshop.

39:25.510 --> 39:28.510
I constantly fear
my own abilities are insufficient

39:28.510 --> 39:29.970
to uphold the family name.

39:30.360 --> 39:32.110
I know I don't have much talent.

39:32.590 --> 39:34.790
But does that mean I should just give in?

39:36.360 --> 39:38.360
Should I just be like you?

39:41.000 --> 39:42.000
Jingdong,

39:43.760 --> 39:44.920
all these years,

39:45.710 --> 39:48.310
I've seen clearly
how much effort and devotion

39:48.510 --> 39:50.030
you've poured into Li Ink.

39:50.030 --> 39:51.630
I have held it all in my heart.

39:52.670 --> 39:54.110
It has been hard on you.

39:59.000 --> 39:59.960
Take a rest first.

39:59.960 --> 40:00.190
Okay.

40:00.190 --> 40:01.120
Have some water.

40:02.280 --> 40:03.110
Qiu'e,

40:03.150 --> 40:03.880
Zhengliang!

40:04.800 --> 40:05.480
Zhen?

40:05.760 --> 40:06.510
Zhen!

40:07.880 --> 40:09.080
Qiu'e, are you tired?

40:09.940 --> 40:12.740
Just seeing you
makes all my tiredness disappear.

40:13.590 --> 40:14.400
Zhen,

40:14.670 --> 40:16.630
what are you going to buy
on Sibao Street?

40:16.630 --> 40:18.160
Did you bring enough money?

40:20.960 --> 40:21.150
Here.

40:21.150 --> 40:22.000
No, Qiu'e.

40:22.110 --> 40:23.920
I don't need your money.

40:24.030 --> 40:24.960
On the contrary,

40:25.000 --> 40:25.840
today

40:26.150 --> 40:27.280
I came here to earn money.

40:27.280 --> 40:28.150
"Earn money?"

40:29.400 --> 40:30.400
How?

40:30.550 --> 40:32.110
I want to take on lamp-burning work
to make lampblack.

40:32.110 --> 40:33.550
Lamp-burning?

40:33.880 --> 40:34.710
What's that?

40:34.710 --> 40:36.880
Producing lampblack takes time and effort,

40:36.880 --> 40:39.280
so major ink workshops usually
hire people to make it for them.

40:39.280 --> 40:40.550
As long as you pay the deposit

40:40.550 --> 40:41.680
or have a guarantor,

40:41.710 --> 40:43.190
anyone can collect the raw materials

40:43.190 --> 40:44.590
and lamps to burn at home.

40:44.590 --> 40:45.760
And the major ink workshops

40:45.760 --> 40:46.760
will pay you

40:46.760 --> 40:48.760
according to the quality produced.

40:49.280 --> 40:50.760
But if the quality is poor

40:50.880 --> 40:52.480
and their reputation suffers,

40:52.480 --> 40:53.800
not only must you pay double
in compensation,

40:53.800 --> 40:54.880
but in the worst cases,

40:54.880 --> 40:56.800
you may be barred from
entering the ink trade ever again.

40:56.800 --> 40:57.280
That...

40:57.510 --> 40:58.280
That won't do.

40:58.280 --> 40:59.000
Zhen,

40:59.440 --> 41:01.230
I'll take care of
all the household expenses.

41:01.230 --> 41:03.090
You don't need to take such a risk.

41:03.480 --> 41:04.210
Zhengliang,

41:05.000 --> 41:06.330
over the past few years,

41:06.400 --> 41:07.030
my study of ink-making

41:07.030 --> 41:08.880
has cost the family a great deal of money,

41:08.880 --> 41:09.840
with no return.

41:10.150 --> 41:11.630
Now that I've succeeded in learning,

41:11.630 --> 41:14.890
I naturally want to help
earn some money for the household.

41:15.440 --> 41:16.670
Besides...

41:21.000 --> 41:22.000
Besides what?

41:22.000 --> 41:23.280
Besides,

41:23.320 --> 41:26.000
the best sister-in-law in the world
has just joined our family.

41:26.000 --> 41:27.550
How can we mistreat her?

41:27.710 --> 41:28.920
You're just like your brother,

41:28.920 --> 41:29.800
never serious.

41:31.190 --> 41:31.960
Fine then.

41:32.470 --> 41:33.190
Which ink workshop

41:33.190 --> 41:34.590
are you planning to go to?

41:36.590 --> 41:37.320
Zhengliang,

41:37.920 --> 41:39.320
I've thought it through.

41:39.670 --> 41:41.920
I want to go to Li's Ink Workshop.

41:43.230 --> 41:44.510
Why go to the main family's workshop?

41:44.510 --> 41:46.110
One of their lampblack-making masters

41:46.110 --> 41:47.630
left a few days ago,

41:47.800 --> 41:49.800
so the quality of their lampblack
has declined.

41:49.800 --> 41:51.360
So they'll be offering

41:51.480 --> 41:53.190
a slightly higher price for lampblack.

41:53.190 --> 41:54.550
Business is business.

41:56.280 --> 41:57.010
Zhengliang,

41:57.510 --> 41:58.840
let her do as she wishes.

41:58.880 --> 41:59.630
I believe

41:59.670 --> 42:02.270
she's thought everything through
carefully.

42:03.550 --> 42:05.080
When family members take on

42:05.800 --> 42:07.840
lampblack work,
they don't need to pay a deposit.

42:07.840 --> 42:09.170
That works in our favor.

42:10.550 --> 42:11.760
Even so,

42:12.030 --> 42:13.360
precisely because of that,

42:13.360 --> 42:14.800
I insist on paying the deposit.

42:14.800 --> 42:16.030
Otherwise, they'll think

42:16.030 --> 42:17.830
we're taking advantage of them.

42:19.360 --> 42:20.160
That's right.

42:20.800 --> 42:21.800
Business is business—

42:21.800 --> 42:22.920
you do the work, you get paid.

42:22.920 --> 42:24.230
If a deposit is due, pay it.

42:24.230 --> 42:25.190
Here, take this.

42:25.800 --> 42:27.000
No, Sister-in-law!

42:27.280 --> 42:27.710
Take it!

42:27.710 --> 42:28.360
I really don't want it!

42:28.360 --> 42:30.150
I'll figure something out myself.

42:30.150 --> 42:31.150
You two siblings—

42:31.190 --> 42:32.030
when you get stubborn,

42:32.030 --> 42:33.290
you're exactly alike.

42:33.480 --> 42:34.150
Listen to me,

42:34.150 --> 42:34.950
-take it!
-No!

42:35.230 --> 42:36.030
Take it!

42:36.030 --> 42:37.190
Zhen, don't refuse!

42:37.550 --> 42:38.280
Just keep it.

42:38.480 --> 42:39.030
Keep it.

42:41.510 --> 42:42.360
Brother, Sister-in-law,

42:42.360 --> 42:43.150
don't worry.

42:43.840 --> 42:45.920
I'll definitely earn money this time.

42:45.920 --> 42:46.630
Okay.

42:46.710 --> 42:47.880
We believe in you.

42:48.920 --> 42:49.590
Qiu'e,

42:49.630 --> 42:51.320
when will you be done for the day?

42:51.320 --> 42:52.920
In a little while, I suppose.

42:54.440 --> 42:56.510
But this building is so grand.

42:59.120 --> 43:00.600
Yihousheng?

43:00.820 --> 43:04.300
[Yihousheng]
